# Copy to .env if you want to change any of these. Never commit .env. docs/DEPLOY.md,
# "First start". Nothing here is a key: the app makes the stack's own into the volume's
# app/keys at its first start. Model servers, provider keys (OpenRouter), the Discord
# login and the WhatsApp pairing are set up in the app, not here.

# Which optional services start (compose profiles). Remove what you do not want; the app
# runs without them. shellbox: its computer + reset; browser; discord; whatsapp; web: search.
# Add reranker to run the reranker here (docs/DEPLOY.md, "Reranker").
COMPOSE_PROFILES=shellbox,browser,discord,whatsapp,web
# The reranker's model file on Hugging Face (default gpustack/bge-reranker-v2-m3-GGUF:Q8_0)
#RERANKER_MODEL=gpustack/bge-reranker-v2-m3-GGUF:Q4_0

# The agent's home's hard cap in GB: past it no upload lands in its box (docs/DEPLOY.md
# "Shellbox"). Unset: 50. With SHELLBOX_HOME too, shellbox/home-disk.sh makes it a
# disk of that size on the host, the wall for what it writes itself. Past the soft cap
# (default 90% of the hard one) it is told to clean up or ask.
#SHELLBOX_HOME_GB=50
#SHELLBOX_HOME_SOFT_GB=45
# The hour of its shellbox's daily reset, HH:MM in TZ (default 04:00)
#SHELLBOX_RESET_AT=04:00
# How many days its home's morning snapshots are kept (default 7; 0 keeps every one)
#SHELLBOX_SNAPSHOT_KEEP_DAYS=7
#SHELLBOX_HOME=/srv/celine/shellbox

# The WhatsApp connector's memory limit (default 2g) and the largest attachment it
# downloads, in MB (default 100)
#WA_LINK_MEM_LIMIT=2g
#WA_LINK_MAX_MEDIA_MB=100

# Optional. Where the app's port is published (default 127.0.0.1:8766). To reach it
# from other machines use e.g. 8766 or 10.0.0.5:8766. The app keeps the address the setup
# code was entered at (Settings, General, Network). Passkeys need https with a host name, or
# http://localhost. Behind a reverse proxy, CELINE_TRUSTED_PROXIES lists its addresses or
# networks (comma separated); only those may forward client addresses.
# CELINE_PUBLISH=
# Use the reverse proxy's single address, never its whole Docker network.
# CELINE_TRUSTED_PROXIES=172.18.0.2

# Optional. Pull the images from a registry instead of building them, e.g. the
# GitLab project's $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE, and which tag (default latest).
# CELINE_IMAGES=
# CELINE_TAG=

# Optional. The containers' time zone (an IANA name, default UTC): log lines, the
# Discord connector's dates (its "yesterday", the times in what it shows Celine) and the app's
# day and hour counts. Set it to the zone chosen in Settings, General, e.g. Europe/Berlin.
# TZ=
